{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266LDjCdMDk51794635755.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>明天是長者日，長者出行及購物都有優惠。</p><p></p><p>其中65歲或以上，持樂悠咭及長者八達通，明天可免費搭港鐵本地車程，輕鐵及港鐵巴士，亦可免費搭城巴近200條指定巴士路線，及九巴、龍運巴士大部分路線。</p><p></p><p>多個景點亦免費開放予「老友記」，包括山頂纜車、海洋公園、科學館及太空館等。</p><p></p><p>餐飲、零售及超市等亦提供優惠。部分優惠只要年滿60歲都可享有，詳情可到社聯網站查詢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:41:00.109330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:19:43.253925+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:34:17.377213+00:00","content_hash":"6acf7f1f07fd1f2390ce1c79841bf91a5f5cee0c04ac234ba419b89275556b63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}